      "description": "Aleut (Native American). Basket and Lid, early 20th century. Rye grass, wool, 7 1/4 x 6 1/8 x 6 1/8 in. (18.4 x 15.6 x 15.6 cm). Brooklyn Museum, Gift of Frederic B. Pratt, 36.498a-b.",
